\textbf{Property} & \textbf{Train} & \textbf{Eval (primary)} \\
\midrule
Conversations & 8,000 & 50 \\
Min user turns & 3 & 3 \\
Max sequence length & 2,048 & 2,048 \\
Source & UltraChat train & UltraChat train \\
